1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:03,500
When your dental front desk
is busy or closed,

2
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:06,367
an appointment enquiry can end
before anyone helps.

3
00:00:07,067 --> 00:00:09,500
FlowAudit builds AI phone agents

4
00:00:09,500 --> 00:00:11,933
that support your team
through agreed workflows.

5
00:00:12,600 --> 00:00:14,533
The separate recording below
shows an enquiry,

6
00:00:15,267 --> 00:00:17,733
available times and
a Google Calendar booking,

7
00:00:17,733 --> 00:00:19,533
with privacy beeps
and edited labels.

8
00:00:20,333 --> 00:00:21,333
It's demonstration evidence,

9
00:00:22,033 --> 00:00:23,033
not customer results.

10
00:00:23,700 --> 00:00:26,867
Published US exam, cleaning
and X-ray costs range from

11
00:00:26,867 --> 00:00:28,633
$50 to $350.

12
00:00:28,633 --> 00:00:31,967
That's a fee benchmark,
not a revenue forecast.

13
00:00:32,633 --> 00:00:34,767
Use your own attendance, collections
and costs.

14
00:00:35,433 --> 00:00:37,467
Missed calls aren't automatically lost
patients.

15
00:00:38,033 --> 00:00:41,100
Your scheduling system, appointment types
and forwarding need checking.

16
00:00:41,533 --> 00:00:44,500
Compatibility, patient-data and
security requirements

17
00:00:44,500 --> 00:00:46,367
must be resolved before proceeding.

18
00:00:50,233 --> 00:00:53,067
Urgent calls follow practice-approved
escalation and

19
00:00:53,067 --> 00:00:54,000
human-handoff rules.

20
00:00:54,000 --> 00:00:57,333
The recorded question doesn't
establish validated

21
00:00:57,333 --> 00:01:00,133
clinical triage or a completed
emergency handoff.

22
00:01:00,633 --> 00:01:02,567
Clinical judgment stays with your
team.

23
00:01:03,900 --> 00:01:05,667
Agree scope and investment first.

24
00:01:06,267 --> 00:01:08,533
Agreement and initial payment start
configuration,

25
00:01:09,467 --> 00:01:10,933
followed by testing with your team.

26
00:01:11,533 --> 00:01:13,733
Practice approval comes before
activation.

27
00:01:16,700 --> 00:01:19,633
Book a 15-minute demo and fit
assessment.

28
00:01:19,633 --> 00:01:21,933
Bring your purchasing decision-maker.

29
00:01:22,567 --> 00:01:24,567
Groups should include relevant
approvers.

30
00:01:25,167 --> 00:01:28,933
We'll discuss requirements, investment
and the next decision.
